{
  "bodyHash": "b91c5a5354eaef74",
  "content": "<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">投入战斗：</span>重启</strong></h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_2881910f-6d5f-48cc-bbbb-209bbce7ec68.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">投入战斗</span>:<span style=\"color:#fff\">重启</span>（<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">CIB</span>:<span style=\"color:#fff\">R</span>）</strong>是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">TACZ</span> (<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">Timeless and Classics</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">Zero</span>)</strong></a>的扩展包！其前身是原版<strong>投入战斗（CIB）</strong>扩展包。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>\"CIBR v0.2 中的武士刀和警棍现已整合至模组 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-lesraisins-tactical-equipements\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[TACZ] LesRaisins Tactical Equipements</span></a>。若要使用本扩展包中的近战武器，请确保已安装 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-lesraisins-tactical-equipements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">[TACZ] LesRaisins Tactical Equipements</span></a></span>。\"</strong></p>\n<div><hr></div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>宣传图片</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_a9c1886b-8788-440b-a5f6-372875b779a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"979\" height=\"413\"></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>图片中的武器来自该扩展包。（<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">M4 URGI</span>、<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">Galil ACE 22</span>）</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_1e1cc7d3-2c35-4dda-a8d3-1b6bac9f18c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1050\" height=\"443\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>图片中的武器来自该扩展包。（<span style=\"color:#eccafa\">AK103 Laffey</span>、<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">DAEWOO K2</span>、<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">MK18</span>）</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_10cb607e-024b-47ef-80e6-eed863d83759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"474\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><del style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>图片中的武器来自该扩展包。（<span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">LA-89</span>）</strong></del></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span>该武器已在 CIBR 版本 0.4 中移除</span></strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_4819edbf-fa34-474a-8aab-0eb347bdb6db.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>图片中的武器来自该扩展包。（QBZ 95-1<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">、</span><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">QBZ 191</span>）</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_20c7e2ad-f75d-4562-80ad-7ec0fd2ab667.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"473\"></strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>图片中的武器来自该扩展包。（<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">9A91</span>、<span style=\"color:#34495e\">Type20</span>、AK103、<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">SCORPION EVO 3</span></span>）</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">图片中的所有渲染图均由 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Mineimator</span> 制作。</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>介绍</strong></span></h1>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB:R</strong></span> 是 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB</strong></span> 的重制版，原作者 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>LESHUAN_20</strong> </span>对之前的 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB</strong> </span>扩展包进行了全面的优化和升级。</span></div>\n<div><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB:R</strong></span> 致力于为玩家提供更广泛的独特武器选择。它为 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>TACZ</strong></span> 添加了新的枪械模型、动画和音效，进一步丰富了其军械库。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>主要特性：</strong></span></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>新武器</strong>:</span><br><strong>CIB:R</strong> 扩展包引入了多种新武器，包括现实中的经典枪械、虚构作品中的独特武器以及武器皮肤！<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_9c7a063b-e2ff-4c79-b469-1745a87f1f97.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"663\" height=\"387\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_2d9f9425-2eaf-4be2-b8d7-a324f4c66812.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"414\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>武器工作台</strong>：</span><br>玩家可以通过扩展包中包含的独立武器工作台进行制作和升级，并新增了武器转换模板。<span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_b6625340-88cd-41be-a204-e81cffb8e05b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"668\" height=\"380\"></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>体验优化</strong>:</span><br>与之前的 <strong>CIB</strong> 不同，<strong>CIB:R</strong> 对许多旧版 <strong>CIB</strong> 时代的武器进行了彻底改造，部分武器的模型、纹理和动画都经过了完全重制。<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_e2007331-0855-4be0-be2d-7b5c012dc840.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"404\"><strong>CIB:R</strong> 还优化了旧 <strong>CIB</strong> 模型的多边形数量，并为第三人称视角下的每种武器添加了<strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">低模渲染</span>.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_f12c00e0-80f5-4c3e-a510-f9ff8a05fab6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"382\" height=\"148\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_35a2ac75-6478-4434-a257-7d3754e0646c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"157\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h5><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">1.支持版本：</span></span></strong></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB:R</strong></span> 扩展包支持 TACZ 的 Minecraft 版本</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">1.18.2、1.19.2、1.20.1.</span></h5>\n<div>\n<h5><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">2.</span>支持语言</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">：</span></strong></h5>\n</div>\n<div><code><strong>zh_CN </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[简体中文]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>zh_TW </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[繁体中文]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>zh_HK </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[繁体中文]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>en_US </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[美式英语]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>ja_JP </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[日本語]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>ko_KR </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[한국어]</span></strong></div>\n<h5>(某些地方的翻译可能不够准确。)</h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#fff\">未来计划添加更多语言。</span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>3.安装方法：</strong></span></h5>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">注意：这不是一个模组。请勿将其放入游戏的 \"mods\" 文件夹中，否则将无法正常工作。</span></h5>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">您还需要安装</span><strong> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ</a></span> </strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">模组，以确保此扩展包能正常运行。</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">将扩展包的 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>.zip</strong></span> 文件放置到</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">文件夹中。</span><code><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>.minecraft/tacz</strong></span></code></h5>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">结语</span></strong></h1>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">随着版本的更新，我们为玩家带来了全新的武器和装备体验。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">感谢您体验<strong>投入战斗：重启 (CIB:R)</strong>。希望您喜欢这些新武器和战术玩法。您的支持是我们不断改进的动力，期待您的反馈和建议！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#fff;float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_071c1608-7f67-487f-b88c-744bce5a9935.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"357\" height=\"113\">&nbsp;<img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_b273fbdf-141c-45a2-acaf-b729550899a7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"266\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>以下是旧文档。</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_49eff4f1-94cd-4144-9fd1-398c128c3310.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"134\"></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>CIB 时期旧废弃文档</strong></h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><em>本文档适用于 CIB 与 TACZ 1.0.3 以下版本的兼容。</em></div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b05b1ecc-b73a-4215-abba-965822a515e0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"358\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">永恒经典</span> </strong><strong style=\"color:#58b6f4\">Zero </strong><span style=\"color:#89261d\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">X</span> </span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">CHARGE</span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">IN<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">TO BATTLE <span style=\"color:#fff\">PACK</span></span></span></strong></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">这是社区的武器扩展包，您需要安装其模组依赖项 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Guns:Zero</a></span></span></strong></h2>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">必须安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db\">Timeless and Classics Guns: Zero</span></a> 模组并将其放置在游戏目录的 mods 文件夹中，否则枪包将无法生效</span></strong></h1>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">这不是一个模组。不要把它放在 mods 里！！！！！！</span></strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>扩展概述：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>这是 TACZ 的扩展包<br>名称为投入战斗，(缩写为 CIB)</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>截图</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><strong style=\"color:#7e8c8d;font-size:16px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_780e7a56-3b05-4fcf-9a4e-c0a10935944a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>IMI GALIL ACE 22</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5fed4d26-8e45-4758-bae2-a925577e6472.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>使命召唤 19 MWII&nbsp; &nbsp;M4 URGI</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4913b06d-8860-4305-bf19-2c67b09dc587.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>QBZ 95-1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_35637525-c087-4e80-a7cd-dd634d574197.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>Origin12 (改装)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e65b1ecc-b73a-4215-abba-965822a515e0.jpg\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>HK-USP (改装)</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>下载 ZIP 文件，找到您的 Minecraft 游戏目录，解压并将文件导入到以下路径</strong></span></p><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><code><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">{config<strong>/</strong>tacz<strong>/</strong>custom}</span></code></span><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>这是文件路径</strong></span><code><span style=\"color:#3598db\"> </span>&nbsp;</code></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">再次强调，这不是一个模块，而是一个扩展包。您需要安装依赖模块才能正常运行，并将其正确导入到枪械包路径中，否则扩展包将无法运行。</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>注意事项：</strong></span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>严禁未经授权的修改和重新分发此包。</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>此版本为官方正式版，但仍存在许多问题。</strong></span></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>开发进度说明：</strong></span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">目前武器包中包含十种武器。只有在枪械包测试版确认无误后，我们才会考虑添加一些新武器。</span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>我们非常感谢您的反馈，以便不断改进质量。</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>当前问题：</strong></span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>NEGEV动画尚未重置，弹性链存在Bug。</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>部分武器动画和模型可能不够完整。</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>最后寄语：</strong></span></h1>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>希望您喜欢我们的武器包。<br>如果有任何问题，欢迎提供反馈，我们将根据您的反馈进行调整或更新。<br></strong></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
